<</AP<</N 1909 0 R>>/BS<</S/S/Type/Border/W 0>>/Border[0 0 0]/Contents(4 4  Given inline-eq-IEq94  rounds in typical FL training, storing auxiliary models per round makes Exact-Fun extremely memory-inefficient, and even infeasible in our Llama-3.2 experiments . In contrast, the storage cost of bmt  and mmt  depends only on the number of clients, making them more memory-efficient in cross-silo settings with 10…100 clients.)/Dest(10994_2026_7117_Article.indd:Dest_Footnote_2947_22260:240)/F 4/H/N/Rect[371.771 142.159 375.096 129.37]/StructParent 132/Subtype/Link/Type/Annot>>
